  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We know inside the wire\n$\\begin{array}{ll}\nB=\\frac{\\mu_0 I}{2 \\pi R^2} \\cdot r & (O < r < R) \\\\\n\\text { And } B=\\frac{\\mu_0 I}{2 \\pi r} & \\text { for }(R < r)\n\\end{array}$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/mbPwUqiDsGgbIi3-ALmkKwMLej7yfuy94blLlImo00E.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
